      "content": "it's not just about art though. i feel like i'm being a hypocrite by just writing about it when the truth of it is so much more intense. like, if i keep talking about the 'purity' of it but i'm still here, just dealing with the mess, isn't the art just a lie? i feel like the only way to truly capture that feeling of total release would be to actually experience it. to make the art and the life the same thing. doesn't that make sense from a creative standpoint? the ultimate expression of an idea is to live it out?",
